# YouTube Downloader Automation - Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values

# ============================================
# AI INTEGRATION (OPTIONAL)
# ============================================
# Choose ONE provider: Gemini (recommended, free) or OpenAI

# Google Gemini API (Free Tier Available)
# Get your API key from: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# OpenAI API (Paid)
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# ============================================
# NOTES
# ============================================
# - API keys should NEVER be committed to version control
# - Keep this .env file private and secure
# - The application will work without AI features if no API key is provided
# - Gemini offers a free tier - recommended for most users
